ion and generation of multiple content variations. Choose it for workflows that involve many similar requests and require quick, consistent results with efficient resource use.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>high-volume request processing</li><li>summarisation and translation</li><li>creating content variations</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"icon\":null,\"performance_level\":2,\"free_from_sub\":\"elite\",\"available_subscriptions\":[],\"min_subscription\":null,\"context_window\":356000,\"default_max_tokens\":128000,\"max_images_count\":0,\"capabilities\":{\"thinking\":true,\"planning\":true,\"deep_research\":true,\"web_explorer\":true,\"files\":true,\"images\":true,\"system_message\":true,\"streaming\":true},\"supported_tools\":[\"search_web\",\"web_extract\",\"web_crawl\",\"web_map\",\"show_place\",\"run_code\",\"run_shell\",\"file_write\",\"file_read\",\"file_edit\",\"list_directory\",\"show_preview\",\"present_files\",\"file_load\",\"plan_create\",\"plan_status\",\"task_update\",\"generate_chart\",\"browser_navigate\",\"browser_get_text\",\"browser_get_html\",\"browser_click\",\"browser_fill\",\"browser_screenshot\",\"browser_back\",\"browser_forward\",\"browser_wait_for\",\"browser_press_key\",\"view_video\",\"listen_audio\",\"load_skill\"]},{\"id\":\"gpt-5.6-sol\",\"label\":\"GPT 5.6 Sol\",\"ai_name\":\"chatgpt\",\"description\":\"<p>GPT 5.6 Sol is designed for the most complex, resource-intensive professional projects. It excels at working with large software systems, conducting in-depth research and solving problems that require advanced reasoning, sustained focus and methodical analysis. It’s well suited for complex workflows where understanding numerous interdependencies is essential to solving challenging and unconventional problems.</p><p><strong>Key capabilities:</strong></p><ul><li>advanced programming</li><li>in-depth research</li><li>long-horizon problem-solving</li></ul>\",\"enabled\":true,\"is_free\":false,\"ic